# Repot export

Generated by Repot 0.1.0 on 2026-11-02 10:00 UTC

Source: macOS -> Target: macOS

Review these files before restoring. Install the required package and version managers first.

## Restore

### Brewfile

```bash
brew bundle --file=Brewfile
```

### .tool-versions

```bash
mise install # or asdf install
```

### npm-global.txt

```bash
xargs npm install -g < npm-global.txt
```

### vscode-extensions.txt

```bash
xargs -n1 code --install-extension < vscode-extensions.txt
```

### Other runtimes

```bash
rustup toolchain install stable
```

### Config files

Back up existing destination files before copying.

| Source | Destination |
| --- | --- |
| `files/home/.zshrc` | `~/.zshrc` |

### oh-my-zsh plugins

Install oh-my-zsh first: https://ohmyz.sh

```bash
git clone https://github.com/zsh-users/zsh-autosuggestions ~/.oh-my-zsh/custom/plugins/zsh-autosuggestions
```

